                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a3ef7257-b70f-3827-b0b0-e8f0b3c20aec",
                        "entry_id": "71d94027-67f0-349d-b72e-bf50b212f8d8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sexualtrieb, der von der empirischen Norm abweicht und sich in dranghaften Verhaltensweisen äußert, welche Leid oder Beeinträchtigungen bei betroffenen Personen hervorrufen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbf669fc-b82f-41a9-a92d-c6db408c5f88",
                                "sense_id": "a3ef7257-b70f-3827-b0b0-e8f0b3c20aec",
                                "text": "Es ist nicht trivial Paraphilien von einem \"normalen\" Sexualtrieb zu unterscheiden."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ca60740-d621-4bc4-b420-0d703b26304f",
                                "sense_id": "a3ef7257-b70f-3827-b0b0-e8f0b3c20aec",
                                "text": "„Ziel ist nicht, wie Laien oft denken, die vollkommene Heilung von abnormen sexuellen Verlangen wie der Pädophilie, die in der Medizinersprache als Paraphilie zusammengefasst ist.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9cbdc202-8abf-4f00-b433-5ee49293e884",
                        "source_entry_id": "71d94027-67f0-349d-b72e-bf50b212f8d8",
                        "source_sense_id": "a3ef7257-b70f-3827-b0b0-e8f0b3c20aec",
                        "target_lang_word": "paraphilia",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "paraphilia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d825a514-b645-3cc8-99d1-f2963aa9e7d4",
                                        "entry_id": "fd379dc1-06d5-31e7-bdcd-21162f3976ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An abnormal sexual arousal or attraction, especially to objects or situations that are not of a sexual nature; typically of extreme or pathological nature."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ffd9953-5b97-49fc-ac73-ba52812ac89e",
                                                "sense_id": "d825a514-b645-3cc8-99d1-f2963aa9e7d4",
                                                "text": "Despite the serial aspect of these killings, lust murder still remains a distinct subcategory of both sexual and serial murder. It is also referred to as erotophonophilia, one of the most extreme forms of paraphilia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "135d91e9-9f45-4fea-b142-50707b7ce573",
                                                "sense_id": "d825a514-b645-3cc8-99d1-f2963aa9e7d4",
                                                "text": "Formal study will be necessary to clarify the nature, prevalence, and interrelations of plushophilia, fursuitism, and autoplushophilia among furverts and to document the nature and extent of any co-occurring paraphilias."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c68b49b-aa14-4af1-ae02-f591b2e24d76",
                                                "sense_id": "d825a514-b645-3cc8-99d1-f2963aa9e7d4",
                                                "text": "Yes, really. Blanchard has expanded the DSM's \"paraphilia\" section (where crimes such as paedophilia and exhibitionism go) to include transvestic disorder."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18c6c4c8-653a-477b-8909-7fc856af5bac",
                                                "sense_id": "d825a514-b645-3cc8-99d1-f2963aa9e7d4",
                                                "text": "As Stoller says, \"perversion is a sturdy word, throbbing with assumptions, while paraphilia is a wet noodle.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdb1a576-6aac-4760-8bd0-f5f9e4d86de9",
                                                "sense_id": "d825a514-b645-3cc8-99d1-f2963aa9e7d4",
                                                "text": "Other paraphilias are more blatantly transgressive and usually illegal: amokoscisia (desire to slash or mutilate females); anthropophagy (cannibalism); anthropophagolagnia (rape accompanied by cannibalism); […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d701d914-3e2e-37e3-a84b-b5727aa4f87f",
                                        "entry_id": "fd379dc1-06d5-31e7-bdcd-21162f3976ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexual arousal in response to sexual objects or situations which may interfere with the capacity for reciprocal affectionate sexual activity or lead to clinically significant distress or impairment (e.g. are obligatory, require participation of unconsenting individuals, lead to legal issues)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7c90f1af-fd6c-4b0b-99af-76178c5fb804",
                        "source_entry_id": "71d94027-67f0-349d-b72e-bf50b212f8d8",
